content:
`generate_scene_plan` response:

```json
{
  "actions": [
    {
      "type": "form",
      "tool": "duneshaper",
      "parameters": {
        "size": "large",
        "curvature": "sweeping",
        "spacing": "moderate"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "carve",
      "tool": "wind_carver",
      "parameters": {
        "pattern": "ridged",
        "depth": "moderate",
        "width": "narrow"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "place",
      "tool": "rock_generator",
      "parameters": {
        "formation": "oasis",
        "size": "medium",
        "distribution": "clustered"
      }
    }
  ],
  "metadata": {
    "goals_realized": [
      "create a vast dune sea with sweeping curves",
      "carve wind-shaped ridges into the dunes",
      "include a rocky oasis within the dune sea"
    ]
  }
}
```

The actions from the `generate_scene_plan` response will create a sweeping dune sea, carve wind-shaped ridges, and place a rocky oasis, fulfilling the geological goals and rationale outlined above.
